  "notes": "Primary is taught in three cycles: P1–P3 (local language of instruction), P4 (transition year) and P5–P7; PLE is sat at the end of P7. The competency-based Lower Secondary Curriculum began with S1 in 2020 (UCE after S4); the revised Advanced Secondary Curriculum began with S5 in 2025 (UACE after S6). Class names did not change."
